n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Closed (keyhole) surgery of the knee, shoulder, hip, ankle, elbow and wrist. Recovery is quick and in many cases no hospital stay is needed.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Robotic joint replacement</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Joint replacement for arthritis performed with robotic technology, special navigation systems and computer assistance.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Knee, hip and shoulder replacement</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Joint prostheses for advanced joint wear, for pain-free movement.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sports injuries</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment of ligament, meniscus, tendon and cartilage injuries from sport.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Foot and ankle</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment of foot and ankle injuries and conditions.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Shoulder surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surgical treatment of shoulder injuries, instability and wear.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cartilage transplantation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For extensive cartilage damage where other treatments have failed, to preserve the joint and prevent or delay the need for a prosthesis.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Biological cartilage treatments</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Biological (orthobiological) treatment of cartilage diseases.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Spine surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment of spinal fractures, infections, tumours and congenital or acquired curvatures.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fracture and trauma care</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment of fractures and injuries and their consequences.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Paediatric orthopaedics</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Diagnosis and treatment of orthopaedic problems in children.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Orthopaedic oncology</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Diagnosis and treatment of bone and soft tissue tumours.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your orthopaedic consultation with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Orthopaedics and traumatology deal with the diagnosis, treatment and rehabilitation of problems of the bones, joints, muscles and spine in adults and children, including injuries from daily life and sport. Our partner hospital combines experienced orthopaedic surgeons with robotic and navigation technology and works with physical therapy and rehabilitation for a quick return to daily [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 259, "menu_order": 3, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "orthopedics-and-traumatology", "class_list": ["post-270", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "htt